mentStatus.CREATED,\n            ),\n        )\n        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(saved)\n    }\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/{shipmentId}\")\n    fun getById(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment =\n        repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n    @GetMapping\n    fun list(): List<Shipment> = repository.findAll()\n}","new_string":"package com.unityinflow.sample.shipment\n\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ConflictException\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ErrorCode\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.FieldViolation\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ResourceNotFoundException\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ValidationException\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.order.InMemoryOrderRepository\nimport org.springframework.http.HttpHeaders\nimport org.springframework.http.HttpStatus\nimport org.springframework.http.ResponseEntity\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.PathVariable\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.PostMapping\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestBody\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestMapping\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RequestParam\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.RestController\n\n@RestController\n@RequestMapping(\"/shipments\")\nclass ShipmentController(\n    private val repository: InMemoryShipmentRepository,\n    private val orderRepository: InMemoryOrderRepository,\n) {\n\n    @PostMapping\n    fun create(@RequestBody request: CreateShipmentRequest): ResponseEntity<Shipment> {\n        if (request.quantity < 1) {\n            throw ValidationException(\n                \"Invalid quantity\",\n                listOf(FieldViolation(\"quantity\", \"quantity must be positive\")),\n            )\n        }\n\n        if (repository.existsById(request.shipmentId)) {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_ALREADY_EXISTS,\n                \"A shipment with id '${request.shipmentId}' already exists\",\n            )\n        }\n\n        val order = orderRepository.findById(request.orderId)\n        if (order != null) {\n            val existingShipments = repository.findByOrderId(request.orderId)\n            val allocated = existingShipments\n                .filter { it.status != ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED }\n                .sumOf { it.quantity }\n\n            if (allocated + request.quantity > order.quantity) {\n                throw ConflictException(\n                    ErrorCode.VALIDATION_FAILED,\n                    \"Shipment would exceed order quantity\",\n                )\n            }\n        }\n\n        val saved = repository.save(\n            Shipment(\n                shipmentId = request.shipmentId,\n                orderId = request.orderId,\n                carrier = request.carrier,\n                status = ShipmentStatus.CREATED,\n                quantity = request.quantity,\n            ),\n        )\n        return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(saved)\n    }\n\n    @GetMapping(\"/{shipmentId}\")\n    fun getById(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment =\n        repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n    @GetMapping\n    fun list(\n        @RequestParam(defaultValue = \"100\") limit: Int,\n        @RequestParam(defaultValue = \"0\") offset: Int,\n    ): ResponseEntity<List<Shipment>> {\n        if (limit < 1 || limit > 100) {\n            throw ValidationException(\n                \"Invalid limit\",\n                listOf(FieldViolation(\"limit\", \"limit must be between 1 and 100\")),\n            )\n        }\n        if (offset < 0) {\n            throw ValidationException(\n                \"Invalid offset\",\n                listOf(FieldViolation(\"offset\", \"offset must be 0 or more\")),\n            )\n        }\n\n        val shipments = repository.findAllPaged(limit, offset)\n        val headers = HttpHeaders().apply {\n            add(\"X-Total-Count\", repository.count().toString())\n        }\n        return ResponseEntity.ok().headers(headers).body(shipments)\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\n    fun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n        val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n        if (shipment.status != ShipmentStatus.CREATED) {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.VALIDATION_FAILED,\n                \"Cannot confirm shipment in ${shipment.status} status\",\n            )\n        }\n\n        val updated = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED)\n        repository.save(updated)\n        return updated\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/deliver\")\n    fun deliver(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n        val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n        if (shipment.status != ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED) {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.VALIDATION_FAILED,\n                \"Cannot deliver shipment in ${shipment.status} status\",\n            )\n        }\n\n        val updated = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.DELIVERED)\n        repository.save(updated)\n        return updated\n    }\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/cancel\")\n    fun cancel(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): Shipment {\n        val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n        if (shipment.status != ShipmentStatus.CREATED) {\n            throw ConflictException(\n                ErrorCode.VALIDATION_FAILED,\n                \"Cannot cancel shipment in ${shipment.status} status\",\n            )\n        }\n\n        val updated = shipment.copy(status = ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED)\n        repository.save(updated)\n        return updated\n    }\n}"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2490,"cache_read_input_tokens":44585,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2490},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"22d3cc51-bfa2-4dfc-9b4e-b21efd79c444","uuid":"d26da7e2-bd55-4362-90ff-51d7fe7bad55","timestamp":"2026-09-17T13:13:01.241Z","request_id":"req_011Cf951TW4m5aJ6mPbZMjHs","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_016pdCRPjn77RAHd56hAvkip":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-fe943ecf-1b3e-48cc-93e3-b8ca0aeeb54c/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt","old_string":"package com.unityinflow.sample.shipment\n\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ConflictException\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ErrorCode\nimport com.unityinflow.sample.api.ResourceNotFoundException\nimport org.springframework.http.HttpStatus\nimport org.springframework.http.ResponseEntity\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.PathVariable\nimport org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.PostMapping\nimport org.springframework