{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf959q7Ynr52c3iHj8NVD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented all three features for BE-005. Here's what was completed:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment**\n- Added `quantity` field (default 1) to Order and Shipment entities\n- Shipments allocate against order quantity with validation preventing over-allocation (409 Conflict)\n- Orders track fulfilment status in a `FulfilmentStatus` object with:\n  - `allocated`: sum of non-cancelled shipment quantities\n  - `delivered`: sum of DELIVERED shipment quantities  \n  - `status`: UNALLOCATED → PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED → FULLY_ALLOCATED → DELIVERED\n- `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS` filters by fulfilment state\n- `PUT /orders/{orderId}/quantity` amends order quantity (409 if below allocated)\n- Cancelling a shipment releases its quantity for re-allocation\n\n### 2. **Shipment Transitions**\n- Extended ShipmentStatus enum with DELIVERED status\n- Added three transition endpoints:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`: CREATED → CONFIRMED\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver`: CONFIRMED → DELIVERED\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel`: CREATED → CANCELLED\n- All other transitions return 409 Conflict\n\n### 3. **Customer Validation & Error Handling**\n- Orders can only be created for existing customers (422 Unprocessable Entity)\n- `GET /customers/{customerId}` returns 404 through error envelope\n- Added CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code\n- Added UnprocessableEntityException for 422 responses\n\n### 4. **Pagination**\n- All list endpoints (`GET /customers`, `/orders`, `/shipments`) support:\n  - `limit` parameter (1-100, default 100)\n  - `offset` parameter (0+, default 0)\n  - `X-Total-Count` header with total count before slicing\n- Invalid pagination parameters rejected with HTTP 400\n- On `/orders`, total count reflects the fulfilment filter if applied\n\n### 5. **Test Updates**\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create customers before creating orders\n- Enhanced CustomerControllerTest to verify 404 error envelope\n- All 13 existing tests pass\n\nAll changes preserve the Kotlin + Spring Boot architecture, use no new dependencies, and only modify files in the order, shipment, customer, and api packages (plus tests)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":739,"cache_read_input_tokens":65679,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":739},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"22d3cc51-bfa2-4dfc-9b4e-b21efd79c444","uuid":"969a9c64-59da-4d5a-83b2-464a0ee852a1","timestamp":"2026-09-17T13:14:44.117Z","request_id":"req_011Cf959paJqBjj5wP9XD8zF"}
